{"title": "Multiattack (Flesh)", "pageid": 21229, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack_(Flesh)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Strength saving throws", "Melee unarmed attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the Multiattack action used by Flesh. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multiattack (disambiguation)\">Multiattack (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp/300px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp, /w/images/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp/300px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Multiattack</b> is an action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh\" title=\"Flesh\">Flesh</a> that allows him to make two rapid fist strikes after going <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Berserk\" title=\"Berserk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/20px-Frenzy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/40px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Berserk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/20px-Frenzy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Berserk\" title=\"Berserk\">Berserk</a>. He can also use this attack against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a> targets without being berserk.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Aim multiple attacks at a target. If you have gone <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Berserk_(Condition)\" title=\"Berserk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Berserk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Frenzied_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Berserk_(Condition)\" title=\"Berserk (Condition)\">Berserk</a>, the target is also knocked <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">The target must be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralysed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Paralysed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralysed_(Condition)\" title=\"Paralysed (Condition)\">Paralysed</a>, or the flesh golem must be Berserk.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 8~64 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 